[EXAMPLES]
Convert all records to SQL INSERT statements:

  rec2sql contacts.rec

Include CREATE TABLE DDL:

  rec2sql --create-table contacts.rec

Convert a specific record type:

  rec2sql -t Task todo.rec

Use a custom table name:

  rec2sql -t Task -T tasks_table todo.rec

Create a complete SQLite database:

  rec2sql -c contacts.rec | sqlite3 contacts.db

